cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this collection, cite it and the upstream datasets relevant to your subset."
type: dataset
title: "Skill Version Dataset: Real Updates, Malicious-Source Updates, and Malicious Content Clones"
authors:
  - name: "gwkgwk"
repository-code: "https://github.com/gwkgwk/skill-version-dataset"
url: "https://github.com/gwkgwk/skill-version-dataset"
date-released: "2026-11-22"
abstract: >-
  A research collection of 500 official-source Skill updates with user-reported
  human-confirmed benign labels, 37 malicious-source Skill
  updates, and 20 exact-content malicious clone pairs. Source labels and
  provenance limits are recorded separately. Manual-review labels were supplied
  by the dataset owner and were not independently reproduced by the collector. No benign-to-malicious update
  transition has been fully verified. Original contributions and third-party
  artifacts have separate license scopes; see LICENSE.md.
